#ATOMS
C 644.149
N 199.558
O 501.095
S 10.000
Gd_fast 2.639
H 1657.363
Na 11.574
Cl 10.934

#BOUND_FREE_EXCLUSIONS
Gd_fast
Na
Cl
S


#VOLUME
30251.2         // Volume per molecule in Angstrom^3.
500         // Length scale of sample in Angstrom. Used for effective escape rate of photo-electrons (assumes surrounded by a void).
none // Spatial boundary shape - options are none, spherical, cylindrical, planar

#PULSE
8480         // Photon energy in eV.
40           // Pulse width in femtoseconds (defined as FWHM for Gaussian pulse).
gaussian       // Pulse shape

#USE_COUNT
true    // active (using count)?
0.13  // Photon density (x10^12 ph.µm-2)

#NUMERICAL
15000      // Initial guess for number of time step points for rate equation.
24            // Number of threads in OpenMP.

#DYNAMIC_GRID
N           // L  // Grid regions preset, options are: dismal, low, medium, high, (referring to accuracy),  and no_dirac (static region is used rather than dynamic dirac regions)
10.05            // Grid update period in fs, (dynamic grid only).
2

#OUTPUT
800         // Number of time steps in the output files.
4000        // number of free-electron grid points in output file.
N            // Write atomic charges in a separate file (Y/N)?
Y            // Write intensity in a separate file (Y/N)?
Y            // Write data for molecular dynamics (MD) in a separate file (Y/N)?

#LOAD
lys_galli_LF_backup

#DEBUG
99 //10     // Simulation cutoff time in fs
0.01    // Interval to update current timestep [fs].
####END#####

Notes:
Solvated
Requires a very large amount of memory as the second shell is able to be ionised.
Pulse set so that theoretical average of 1 photoionisation event per Gd 